bugs.report:
The usage line for an optional argument with a Choice type shows doubled square brackets.

```python
@click.command()
@click.argument("method", type=click.Choice(["foo", "bar", "baz"]), required=False)
def cli(method):
    pass
```

`cli --help` prints `Usage: cli [OPTIONS] [[foo|bar|baz]]` instead of `Usage: cli [OPTIONS] [foo|bar|baz]`. The same happens with `nargs=-1` and with `click.DateTime` arguments.
